{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28723","headline":"宣州开元寺赠惟真上人 · 杜牧","name":"宣州开元寺赠惟真上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾与径山爲小师，千年僧行衆人知。\n夜深月色当禅处，斋後钟声到讲时。\n经雨绿苔侵古画，过秋红叶落新诗。\n劝君莫厌江城客，虽在风尘别有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}